{
  "about": [
    "Shared test corpus for level-1 redaction. must_redact: applying the rules to text must give expect",
    "exactly. must_keep: applying the rules must return text unchanged. Card and Aadhaar samples are made",
    "up and only pass their check digits; phone numbers are examples. Secret samples are obviously fake.",
    "values_must_redact and values_must_keep: walk the JSON value (object keys are context, see the rules",
    "file); the result must equal expect, or the value unchanged. Integers above 2^53 lose precision in",
    "JavaScript; compare them after parsing."
  ],
